@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Tao luot nop thieu du lieu -> 400 (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Tao luot nop cho bai tap 99 khong ton tai -> 404 (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. Doc luot nop voi id rong -> 404 (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR (negotiate) -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub (/hub thay vi /hubs) -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. (Bo sung) Nop vao bai tap da dong (id = 2) -> 400 (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

